{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:126a3fbedee1f68d","name":"Malkite Poisoner Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-126a3fbedee1f68d","title":"Malkite Poisoner Talent Tree","revision":18958,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:02:35Z","sha256":"e9d44897c974bccb9ab49f5c61738a96be0a4666b78a915ff57d22963a0b8826","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18958","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Malkite%20Poisoner%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-126a3fbedee1f68d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have mastered the deadly arts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," from the masters on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malkii"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malkii?action=edit&redlink=1"},". You can employ a wide array of lethal toxins with which you can quickly and efficiently destroy your targets.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Malkite Techniques"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can apply a toxin to any non-Energy Slashing or Piercing weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". If an attack roll with that weapon also exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", that target is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poisoned"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poisoned"},". Each round on the creature's turn, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," makes an attack roll (1d20 + your Heroic Level) against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". If the attack succeeds, the target takes damage equal to 1d6 + one-half your Heroic Level and moves -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A target moved to the end of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," is unconscious but continues to take damage as long as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," continues to attack. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," attacks each round until it misses, or until the victim is cured with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check (DC 10 + your Heroic Level).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Modify Poison"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Malkite Techniques"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can modify the deliver method of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Contact"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Contact"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ingested"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ingested"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Inhaled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inhaled"},") to another delivery method by succeeding in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Life Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Life_Sciences)"}," check (DC equal to the Poison's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," DC). The Poison's capabilities and specific effects are unchanged.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Numbing Poison"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Malkite Techniques"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any target you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," is automatically denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", for a long as it remains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poisoned"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poisoned"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Undetectable Poison"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Malkite Techniques"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," DC needed to cure a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"}," you have use against a target increases by 5.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vicious Poison"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Malkite Techniques"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poisons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poisons"}," you have used against a target gain a +2 bonus to their attack rolls made against that target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
